{"id":"konzentriert","lemma":"konzentriert","pos":"adj","rank":3299,"glosses":["concentrated","focused"],"ipa":"/kɔnt͡sɛnˈtʁiːɐ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f1/De-konzentriert.ogg/De-konzentriert.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"konzentrierter","superlative":"am konzentriertesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Konzentriert euch auf dieses Problem.","en":"Concentrate your attention on this problem.","words":[null,{"g":"you (pl.)","l":"ihr"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"problem"}]},{"text":"Sie hat sich auf eine Sache konzentriert.","en":"She concentrated on one thing.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"matter"},null]},{"text":"Lasst uns konzentriert bleiben!","en":"Let's stay focused.","words":[{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},null,{"g":"to remain"}]},{"text":"Ich habe mich gezwungen, konzentriert zu bleiben.","en":"I forced myself to stay focused.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to force","l":"zwingen"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to remain"}]},{"text":"Jedermann muss konzentriert bleiben.","en":"Everyone needs to stay focused.","words":[{"g":"everyone"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},null,{"g":"to remain"}]}]}